{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubed and Dangerous</strong> is a challenging action roguelike shooter that seamlessly merges elements of Action RPG build-crafting with the thrill of perma-death roguelike gameplay. Recruit new procedurally generated heroes by completing campaign runs, all based off of the 14 unlockable character classes in the game. Grow your collection, cultivate massive power, and take on the cumulative challenge modes or the Infinite Desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/CP2Action2.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a massive arsenal of items and weapons that use a procedurally generated augmentation system, where no two items will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your best gear even further at the Forge as you constantly shift and change your build to face the challenges ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/ItemScrollComp.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful game-warping relic items by defeating capstone act bosses, each presenting unique gameplay behaviors and challenges. Bosses have unique weak points and disadvantages to discover and exploit as you refine your skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/BossMontage.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chart your path through the overworld, choosing risk/reward as you see fit. Choosing higher danger in your path results in access to more drops and collectables; but push your luck too far and you could face an untimely end. Find towns along the way for a relaxing reprieve and some helpful upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/MapScroll.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock challenge modes, characters, items and more, ensuring endless replayability. Create a strong enough build and you can take on the Infinite Desert and push it to its limits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ACTIVE SUPPORT AND EXPANSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Update 1.3 is now available:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Brand new procedural character collection features and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Class based meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Configurable auto-aim/auto fire/manual mode in game options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Major character system overhaul</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Expanded boss roster, more item/relics/weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> UI Beautification</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Important performance optimizations </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADDITIONAL GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Optimized for PC and Steam Deck</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Auto-saved progress with Cloud saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Continued expansion and improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Physically simulated emergent interactions and fluid controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Objective-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Endless Mode with Friend Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collections and challenges for items and enemies</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Forest for the Trees","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/25b9f55843ab1c323e299c440e933cc4a4522335.jpg"},{"name":"Just Chillin'","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/c43901be1ee75271bf1611930886bd2aedc08a8a.jpg"},{"name":"Charred and Determined","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/0c6d270eaff5d6f5b318e2301935b81f76180926.jpg"},{"name":"Forging Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/57f909f1fd593004020671b6582088865df791ef.jpg"},{"name":"Made of Money","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/c9c2e29342d6408a58fa519a1768b18816e1592a.jpg"},{"name":"All Decked Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/87c1cdbbb33e2a1a13bfe76aa3b35affb4e19a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Just Keep Shooting","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/84e697e13ed1ffddff57a12543344bf5bf2f7bd0.jpg"},{"name":"Fight Choreographer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/9f7932044bd5f9eefb9ffddb5bc32071cee793ef.jpg"},{"name":"Getting in Reps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/0acbfffee5e60b58d96e435a29ce6f8276ce08f4.jpg"},{"name":"Becoming a Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2870580/9baf7ef670eadef7aeacd11e13b173ae5797932e.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2870580?t=1744160221","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744160221","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744160221","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744160221","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p>Massive version 1.3 update brings new features and optimizations to the game. Enjoy a higher enemy density, more power and more challenge, infinitely collectable characters spread across 14 classes, and much more.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cubed and Dangerous</strong> is a challenging action roguelike shooter that seamlessly merges elements of Action RPG build-crafting with the thrill of perma-death roguelike gameplay. Recruit new procedurally generated heroes by completing campaign runs, all based off of the 14 unlockable character classes in the game. Grow your collection, cultivate massive power, and take on the cumulative challenge modes or the Infinite Desert.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/CP2Action2.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect a massive arsenal of items and weapons that use a procedurally generated augmentation system, where no two items will ever be the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your best gear even further at the Forge as you constantly shift and change your build to face the challenges ahead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870580/extras/ItemScrollComp.gif?t=1744160221\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire powerful game-warping relic items by defeating capstone act bosses, each presenting unique gameplay behaviors and challenges. Bosses have unique weak points and disadvantages 